  "body": "MOTIVATED VENDOR - CONDITIONAL OFFERS WELCOME!\r\n\r\nThe auction has passed, the home is still available, and our vendor is motivated to sell! If you've been waiting for the right opportunity to secure a beautifully renovated home in prestigious St Heliers, now is the time to act!\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer, professional couple or savvy investor, this is an opportunity worth exploring. Conditional offers are welcome, so if you need to arrange finance, sell your existing property or satisfy other conditions, let's talk!\r\n\r\nCross lease - Exclusive use land - Ample parking - Beautifully Renovated Brick & Tile - Vacant and ready - Just Move In and Enjoy!\r\n\r\nBathed in sunshine, elevated and effortlessly stylish, this gorgeous two-bedroom home delivers a wonderful combination of contemporary elegance, quality and easy-care coastal living.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully renovated throughout, with a sophisticated palette of soft neutral tones and beautiful finishes, the hard work has been done. Simply move in, unpack and enjoy!\r\n\r\nThe light-filled lounge flows onto a sunny outdoor patio with an elevated outlook, while separate garden areas provide private spaces to relax, entertain or enjoy a morning coffee.\r\n\r\nAnd there's more! Downstairs offers a versatile additional flexi space/garage space, perfect for working from home, hobbies, a quiet retreat or valuable storage, complemented by additional dry storage and off-street parking. Fully lined to accommodate options.\r\n\r\nSmart Buying - Lifestyle, Location & Investment Appeal!\r\n\r\nBricks and mortar in St Heliers - what a wonderful place to invest in your future!\r\n\r\nFor investors, this property presents an appealing opportunity. With its beautiful presentation, low-maintenance appeal and sought-after coastal location, imagine the potential as a stylish Airbnb or short-stay accommodation, subject to the necessary approvals and requirements.\r\n\r\nFor homeowners, it's all about lifestyle! Morning waterfront walks, beautiful beaches, coastal boardwalks, vibrant cafés and St Heliers Village are all part of the attraction, with Auckland's CBD within easy reach.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the benefits of this prestigious Eastern Bays address without the premium price tag so often associated with St Heliers.\r\n\r\nClose to shops, transport and sought-after schools, including St Thomas's School, Selwyn College and Baradene College, this location has enduring appeal.\r\n\r\nAn Opportunity Too Good to Overlook!\r\n\r\nA motivated vendor, a beautifully renovated home, a premium coastal location and the flexibility to present a conditional offer - this is smart buying!\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a stylish lock-up-and-leave, a downsizing opportunity or an investment with potential, 3/44 Whytehead Crescent deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nDon't sit on the sidelines waiting for someone else to recognise the opportunity. Come and see it for yourself!\r\nWe welcome your interest and look forward to helping you secure this little piece of St Heliers luxury.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale: 26 November 2026 at 4:00 pm\r\nOpen Homes: Saturday 21 and Sunday 22 November, 10:30-11:00 am.\r\n\r\nTo download the property files, please go:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/A14C",
